# Room 3: Token Meadow. Tokens grow here like flowers, in beds on the left.
# DHH's cottage, with tiled windows that never overlap, is on the right.
# The path runs north to Sand Hill Bridge. Castle Steve is the speck on
# the western hill.
# Outlines first, fills after: a fill only replaces white.

